comments.body:
Managed to solo it as a level 35 mage.&nbsp; Died...a lot, but finally managed to down him.&nbsp; Getting to him is not the hard part, simply hug the right wall for a bit untill you come to the tent-like thingy.&nbsp; Go up the small ramp behind and you can save yourself some time.&nbsp; I'm not sure which way is easier though; either works.&nbsp; 
If you're soloing it though, the most important thing (especially for cloth-wearers like myself) is to CONCENTRATE ON SHAKA.&nbsp; Take out anyone else who might interfere one at a time, untill you're left with Shaka and his guards.&nbsp; Mages, sheep a guard if you want, I prefer to simply blast him with a pyro and just keep pounding away 'till he goes down.&nbsp; Loot him QUICKLY, while the guards are still hitting you.&nbsp; If you die, you die; it saves you the hassle of trying to kill the guards and running all the way back to Magram, just rez with the head.&nbsp; 
Best done in parties, but you CAN solo it at 34 or less depending on class.&nbsp; Good Luck!
